<title>USA: Fed refrained from open market action.</title>
<headline>Fed refrained from open market action.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve refrained from open market operations on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 1030 EDT/1430 GMT, the time when the Fed usually intervenes in the market, the federal funds rate was quoted at 5-5/8 percent, slightly above the Fed's 5.50 percent target for the rate.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
